Here are my procedures for reading unknown scrolls, depending on which
scrolls are still unidentified:

fire: stash all cloth armor, innocent scrolls, and potions (and bags?) at
least 2 tiles away from you
destroy armor: take off all armor except a readily replaced one (like a +0
helm)
teleportation: if it is cursed, and you took the fire precautions, then
you're in trouble.  So don't read cursed scrolls until you get teleport ID'd
(that's not hard)
enchant armor/weapon: if the unknown scroll of cursed, take off all your
armor and empty hand yourself to prevent damage

I feel really smart when I read that first scroll of fire and nothing burns!
That should give you +1 intelligence or wisdom (only when the fire was is
un-IDd).

Once you ID these scrolls you can read a lot safer.  cursed create monster
and punishment are also problems, but they are very rare.

